Android Maven and Unity UPM tarball

The Maven repository contains GameBridge's sdk-core, sdk-android, and
sdk-unity-bridge modules. Those compiled modules include inlined code from:

- Kotlin standard library 2.1.20, Apache-2.0
  https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/tree/v2.1.20/license
- kotlinx.coroutines 1.10.2, Apache-2.0
  https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.coroutines/blob/1.10.2/LICENSE.txt
- kotlinx.serialization 1.8.1, Apache-2.0
  https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.serialization/blob/v1.8.1/LICENSE.txt

The applicable license texts and upstream notices are in
third-party-licenses/. Gradle resolves the separate Kotlin, AndroidX,
Google, and other dependency artifacts from their configured registries
using the published Maven metadata. Unity Package Manager resolves the
Unity package dependencies using package.json.

